     "texto": [
      "**… alabilir miyim?** = could I have…? **Bakar mısınız?** = can you help me? / could you take a look?",
      "**Anlamadım** = I didn't understand; **tekrar eder misiniz?** = could you repeat that?",
      "**Yardım eder misiniz?** = could you help me? These are useful phrases in a shop, at a station or at the surgery."
